loadscript Serial_Decode
-- $Title: Serial Decode
-- $Product: DMM6500, DAQ6510, DMM7510, SMU2461
-- $Tag: Serial, UART, Decode, Digitize
-- $Description: Decodes an asynchronous serial line with the instrument's own digitizer: recovers baud rate, frame format and bytes, shows them as text or hex, and saves bytes to USB key. Everything auto-detects; everything can be locked.
-- $Version: 1.47
-- $Requires: 1.7.0
-- $Author: Ian Ameline
-- $License: MIT
-- $Icon: sdec_icon

